---
import "./styles.css";
---

<section class="introduction">
  <div class="intro-background"></div>

  <div class="intro-content">
    <div class="intro-name">
      <p class="intro-greeting">Hi, I'm</p>
      <h1>NATTHA</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-text">
      <p class="intro-paragraph-left">
        <span class="intro-highlight">Software Engineer</span> with 4+ years of experience
        building software from idea to implementation, with a strong passion for <b
          >user interaction</b
        >, <b>usability</b>, <b>designing intuitive product experiences</b>, and <b
          >project management</b
        >.
      </p>
      <p class="intro-paragraph-right">
        I’m an open-minded, responsible, and fast learner who enjoys <b
          >solving problems</b
        > and exploring new approaches. I believe <b
          >every problem has its own solutions</b
        >, and I enjoy finding the approach that works best for each situation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="intro-fade"></div>
</section>
